{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"agent_message","text":"The direction budget is now frozen to three tests: (1) the causal outline factorial, (2) tokenwise mediation, and (3) causal representation removal. I’m moving into data collection with held-out-secret evaluation as a hard design requirement; this avoids the common mistake of training and testing leakage classifiers on different stories about the same secrets."}}
